				<StatechartElement Class="Transition" ParentState="ROOT_NODE">
					<Id>1468941090057</Id>
					<Name><![CDATA[transition15]]></Name>
					<Description><![CDATA[to make it so that infected cells can divide, change the source of this, and like transitions from the inner states to the outer state, for stay A, B, and C. 
for states B and C, there will be 2 duplicate transitions that are not necessary. 

then remove the guard from the transitions between states D-H, Ee-H, F-H, G-H.
there is a guard for transitions from state A to B and C that disallows infected cells to divide, remove that guard to allow them to divide. ]]></Description>
					<X>370</X><Y>220</Y>
					<Label><X>10</X><Y>0</Y></Label>
					<PublicFlag>false</PublicFlag>
