			<Events>
				<Event>
					<Id>1466436289833</Id>
					<Name><![CDATA[initalInfection]]></Name>
					<Description><![CDATA[the rate here is fit to the data from the paper,
the equation is exponential

lambda( t ) = lambda( 0 ) * e^(-alpha * t)

here lambda( 0 ) is the inital rate of infection, found to be 6.59
and the loss of infectivity is alpha, found to be .065

This represents the number of infected cells per hour in an assay that originally held 12000 cells. 
thus for each cell individually, the rate is that divided by 12000.

multiplying by E2Checker allows this rate to become 0, where E2Checker is 1 prior to E2 treatment and 0 post treatment.]]></Description>
					<X>360</X><Y>-130</Y>
					<Label><X>10</X><Y>0</Y></Label>
					<PublicFlag>false</PublicFlag>
					<PresentationFlag>true</PresentationFlag>
					<ShowLabel>true</ShowLabel>
					<Properties TriggerType="rate" Mode="cyclic">
						<Timeout Class="CodeUnitValue">
							<Code><![CDATA[1]]></Code>
							<Unit Class="TimeUnits"><![CDATA[HOUR]]></Unit>
						</Timeout>
						<Rate Class="CodeUnitValue">
							<Code><![CDATA[(6.59*(Math.pow(E,(-.065*time()))))/(18000)]]></Code>
							<Unit Class="RateUnits"><![CDATA[PER_HOUR]]></Unit>
						</Rate>
						<Id>1466098169956</Id>
						<OccurrenceAtTime>true</OccurrenceAtTime>
						<OccurrenceDate>1466496000000</OccurrenceDate>
						<OccurrenceTime Class="CodeUnitValue">
							<Code><![CDATA[exponential(0.01)]]></Code>
							<Unit Class="TimeUnits"><![CDATA[HOUR]]></Unit>
						</OccurrenceTime>
						<RecurrenceCode Class="CodeUnitValue">
							<Code><![CDATA[exponential(0.01)]]></Code>
							<Unit Class="TimeUnits"><![CDATA[HOUR]]></Unit>
						</RecurrenceCode>
						<Condition><![CDATA[false]]></Condition>
					</Properties>
					<Action><![CDATA[if(main.FFUs> main.initiallyInfectedCount && main.E2Treatment == false){
initialInfectionF();
//System.out.println(time());
}]]></Action>
